"first (e.g., ``$routes->get('edit', 'PostController::edit');``) and "
"another named route is defined later with the same name as the path of "
"the first route (e.g., ``$routes->get('edit/(:num)', "
"'PostController::edit/$1', ['as' => 'edit']);``), the second route will "
"not be registered because its name will conflict with the automatically "
"assigned name of the first route."
msgstr ""

